01:35:18.000 --> 01:36:00.000
if he'd carry out these three murders. David also wanted his own house and motorhome burned down to make it appear like he too was being targeted. Steinhart agreed. He later said, The idea of killing somebody or hiring someone else to do the killing didn't matter to me. I just wanted the money for drugs. To prove he was serious, David arranged for $600 to be placed in the glove compartment of his car so that Steinhart could purchase guns after he was released. Steinhart agreed that after the killings were complete,

