01:36:00.000 --> 01:36:27.000
he would also help David escape from jail. Richard Steinhart was released in early February 1989. David authorized his attorney to pay his brother, Tom Brown, large installments of money, which would be passed on to Steinhard as he carried out different parts of the plot. David didn't tell Tom what the person. payments were four, he simply said that he needed a favour.

127
01:36:27.000 --> 01:37:02.000
On Monday, February 13, David phoned Steinhart from prison. Steinhart told him that he had killed both Jeffrey Robinson and Detective Jay Newell, stating, bang, bang right in the back of the head. David's response was simply, All right. David had his brother deliver 11,000. $10,000 in cash to Steinhardt within the hour. Soon after, Steinhart told David that he had arranged for a hit woman to be arrested

