01:46:23.000 --> 01:46:53.000
Sinan's first ever television interview was on the Oprah Winfrey show. Sitting across from Oprah, Cinnamon looked like a deer in the headlights as she struggled to answer questions and describe how her father had manipulated her into killing Linda. The power that David still held over her emotions was evident. He's always going to be my father, and I love him, she said. David Brown unsuccessfully appealed his conviction,

