01:48:18.000 --> 01:48:54.000
saying she wasn't ready and needed to focus on re-entering society. Cinnamon found work in the travel industry and married in 1994. She expressed deep remorse for Linda's murder. Despite Linda's young age, she had cared for Cinnamon like a mother, even standing up for her and defending her when David put her down. Speaking to Anne Rule for her book, If You Really Loved Me, Sinnaman said, I feel very ashamed of what I did to Linda.

