01:48:54.000 --> 01:48:59.000
It's very painful knowing I took her life, and she'll never have a chance again. I cry and pray for her often because I loved her. That's what hurts more than anything. I loved her and still believed my father's lies, and I killed her. If there was one wish given to me and it could be anything, I'd wish Linda her life back. There aren't comments yet for this episode. Click on any sentence in the transcript to leave a comment.
